    <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__vertex__traversal_1ga37847adf2ab313359a11a28196cfa565" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1aa30ac2f40da4dbe7d841088a78f957fe" kindref="member">NDXLEdge</ref> *</type>
        <definition>NDXLEdge * ndxlGetVertexFirstEdge</definition>
        <argsstring>(NDXLVertex *_Vertex)</argsstring>
        <name>ndxlGetVertexFirstEdge</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref> *</type>
          <declname>_Vertex</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Gets the first edge connected to a vertex. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">_Vertex</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Target vertex to retrieve the first edge of.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>If _Vertex is either NULL or has no edges, returns NULL, otherwise returns the first <ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1aa30ac2f40da4dbe7d841088a78f957fe" kindref="member">NDXLEdge</ref> pointer connected to _Vertex.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>This function is most commonly used in conjunction with ndxlGetVertexNextEdge, ndxlGetVertexPreviousEdge, and/or ndxlGetVertexLastEdge to iterate over a vertex&apos;s edges. The nearest neighbour vertices can subsequently be retrieved using the appropriate edge getter.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>A return value of NULL does not necessarily indicate an error, as the vertex could have no edges. If unsure, use <ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1ga431ccb893f54f2ce7fe5ead2a8abd3cf" kindref="member">ndxlGetLastErrorCode()</ref> to check.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Errors raised</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gaf6b8bdcb87bdd7944810152b510101e4" kindref="member">NDXL_ARG_ERR</ref> : _Vertex is NULL.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1ga431ccb893f54f2ce7fe5ead2a8abd3cf" kindref="member">ndxlGetLastErrorCode</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
