      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__vertex__traversal_1gac1816923b2d91d36fd628ef8fdb36e02" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1aa30ac2f40da4dbe7d841088a78f957fe" kindref="member">NDXLEdge</ref> *</type>
        <definition>NDXLEdge * ndxlGetVertexNextEdge</definition>
        <argsstring>(NDXLVertex *_Vertex, NDXLEdge *_Edge)</argsstring>
        <name>ndxlGetVertexNextEdge</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref> *</type>
          <declname>_Vertex</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1aa30ac2f40da4dbe7d841088a78f957fe" kindref="member">NDXLEdge</ref> *</type>
          <declname>_Edge</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Gets the next edge in the vertex&apos;s nearest neighbour sequence. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">_Vertex</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Target vertex to retrieve the next edge of.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">_Edge</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Current <ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1aa30ac2f40da4dbe7d841088a78f957fe" kindref="member">NDXLEdge</ref> pointer in vertex&apos;s nearest neighbour sequence.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Returns the next <ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1aa30ac2f40da4dbe7d841088a78f957fe" kindref="member">NDXLEdge</ref> pointer in the vertex&apos;s edge sequence, or NULL if:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>_Vertex is NULL</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>_Edge is NULL</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>_Vertex has no edges</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>_Edge is not connected to _Vertex</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>_Edge is the last edge in the edge sequence of _Vertex</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>This function is most commonly used in conjunction with ndxlGetVertexFirstEdge, ndxlGetVertexPreviousEdge, and/or ndxlGetVertexLastEdge to iterate over a vertex&apos;s edges. The nearest neighbour vertices can subsequently be retrieved using the appropriate edge getter.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>A return value of NULL does not necessarily indicate an error, as the edge could have no successors. If unsure, use <ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1ga431ccb893f54f2ce7fe5ead2a8abd3cf" kindref="member">ndxlGetLastErrorCode()</ref> to check.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Errors raised</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gaf6b8bdcb87bdd7944810152b510101e4" kindref="member">NDXL_ARG_ERR</ref> : _Vertex is NULL.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gaf6b8bdcb87bdd7944810152b510101e4" kindref="member">NDXL_ARG_ERR</ref> : _Edge is NULL.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>NDXL_VELUE_ERR : _Edge is not connected to _Vertex.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
